02:26:37.560 --> 02:26:41.760
that actually experiencing from outside

02:26:41.760 --> 02:26:42.600
as somebody else,

02:26:42.600 --> 02:26:45.543
or you are receiving gratitude
is actually more powerful.

02:26:46.530 --> 02:26:48.900
It's true, but I see why it's true,

02:26:48.900 --> 02:26:50.640
I'm not sure everybody sees.

02:26:50.640 --> 02:26:53.340
If somebody tries to feel gratitude,

02:26:53.340 --> 02:26:55.560
just sit with the eyes clothes

02:26:55.560 --> 02:26:59.160
or watch a movie and
sense the gratitude there,

02:26:59.160 --> 02:27:00.480
it will be clear to you,

02:27:00.480 --> 02:27:03.840
one is very difficult to do
and the other is very easy.

02:27:03.840 --> 02:27:06.480
Hence, if gratitude is
achieved easier this way,

02:27:06.480 --> 02:27:08.430
that's why it works like that.

02:27:08.430 --> 02:27:11.320
Although all the traditional
practices are about you

02:27:12.360 --> 02:27:13.920
and by challenging yourself

02:27:13.920 --> 02:27:16.440
to sense that gratitude yourself,

02:27:16.440 --> 02:27:17.850
they achieve much more powerful thing,

02:27:17.850 --> 02:27:19.763
but this is not the research people

02:27:19.763 --> 02:27:21.540
and the people in the research,

02:27:21.540 --> 02:27:23.490
we don't have a lot of those people.

02:27:23.490 --> 02:27:27.330
So, a lot of the things
that can arrive to us,

02:27:27.330 --> 02:27:29.550
