02:27:51.390 --> 02:27:55.083
maybe more wholesome that appears.

02:27:58.500 --> 02:28:02.833
Yeah, I think this is so this is a state,

02:28:02.833 --> 02:28:04.473
a state of exploration.

02:28:05.670 --> 02:28:09.843
I don't want to have the same
thought if I already had it,

02:28:12.600 --> 02:28:14.370
why would I want to have the same thought?

02:28:14.370 --> 02:28:16.020
I already had it.

02:28:16.020 --> 02:28:18.636
I don't want to have the same practice,

02:28:18.636 --> 02:28:20.130
I don't want to.

